      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's almost hilarious how color picking/customization is a free feature on the [CASIO G-SHOCK 「MY G-SHOCK」](https://booth.pm/en/items/5054545) BOOTH store item from G-SHOCK (without VRChat's additional logo branding), yet each color needs to be bought separately from the VRChat shop.",
