  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "So, I imagine there's some standards set by casio, but you gotta give us -something- for the price. \n\nLike these are better than the booth g-shock because official, no needing OSC apps, and cheaper ($18 for the booth one). \n\nBut, I have a fewsmall notes.\n\n First,\n\n it can be hard to make it fit your avatar with scaling locked to all-3-or-nothing. I think you should unlock all 3 scale angles because wrists are not all the same shape. \n\nSecond, \n\nI think the color picker option should be applied to them, but I imagine casio said no to that idea, so I understand. \n\nThird,\n\n The time displaying your time is great, but I feel it should display your time on -only- yours.  \n\nMy friend in the picture (green watch) is in EST, I am in CST. \n\nIf i look at his watch it should be a 1 hour difference, not my time. \n\nI very much like that we get a watch instead of the time in the VRC menu, and this will even keep me from looking at XS-overlay to see what time it is, but I would prefer it if people could look at my watch, and see -my- time, not theirs. Basically, timezone differences . \n\n\"Oh wow it's 4 AM for you, go the heck to bed,boy!\"",
